    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.3
  m_Text: "The cradle of civilizations and the voice of history.\n From between the
    Tigris and Euphrates, where humanity wrote its first letters, emerged the Feather
    of Legends \u2014 not made of gold or stone, but of eternal glory.\n It is the
    legacy of Sumer, the pulse of Babylon, and the whisper of Ur\u2019s ziggurats.\n
    Only those whose names are carved in the book of heroes may carry it.\n Win it
    in Iraq mode and become the next Iraqi legend \u2014 unforgettable and unbreakable."
