    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The origin of Chilean civilization.\nBetween the Andes Mountains and the
    southern volcanoes, the Bronze Feather was awarded to members of the tribes who
    demonstrated rare skills in intelligence and survival. \nIt is a symbol of pride
    and belonging, once worn on the chests of warriors as proof of their courage
    in the arenas of challenge. Earn it by taking on the challenges of Chile and
    become one of the guardians of the mountain legacy!"
