  m_Text: "The pride of the Persian Empire and the strength of eternal metals. In
    the land of poetry and swords, where civilization met knowledge, the Titanium
    Feather emerged as a symbol of absolute power and an iron mind.\n It is worn
    only by those who walk with the steps of kings and master the words of the wise,
    representing the perfect balance between patience and majesty. \nWin it in Iran
    mode and become the legacy of a glory that never rusts."
