      - question: What is Ahmed's uniform?
        answer:
        - "\u25A1 Black trousers and white shirt"
        - "\u25A1 White trousers and black shirt"
        - "\u25A1 Blue jeans and red shirt"
        - Grey trousers and white T-shirt
        rightAnswer: Grey trousers and white T-shirt
      - question: "\u0645\u0627 \u0645\u0639\u0646\u0649 \u0643\u0644\u0645\u0629
          \"\u0627\u0644\u062D\u0643\u0645\u0629\" \u0641\u064A \u0642\u0648\u0644\u0647
