    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The secret of the white mountains and the wisdom of the ancestors.\n High
    in the Andes, where peaks touch the clouds and the soul breathes with the temples,
    the Platinum Feather was a treasure granted only to those who understood the
    symbols of earth and sky.\n This feather carries the energy of the mountains
    and the spirit of the Tiwanaku civilizations, considered the highest honor awarded
    to a warrior balanced between strength and wisdom.\n Win it in Bolivia mode and
    prove that you belong among the elite of the elite.\n"
