    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.3
  m_Text: "The elegance of nobility and the fire of revolution.\n From palace halls
    to the streets of uprising, the Ruby Feather was born in the heart of Paris,
    carrying the shine of art and the power of change.\n It is a symbol for those
    who blend refined taste with a fiery spirit, granted only to those who master
    their game with royal flair.\n Win it in France mode and become the signature
    of glory on the canvas of victory."
