  m_Text: "The pulse of the savannah and the spirit of the runners.\n From the heart
    of the golden plains, where lions roar and the wind sings, the Golden Feather
    was born as a symbol of speed, courage, and nobility.\n It was awarded to the
    fastest warriors of the Maasai tribes, carried only by those whose hearts matched
    the strength of the sun.\n Earn it through the challenges of Kenya, and become
    the next legend of the savannah!"
