  m_Text: "The shadow of cunning and the secret of twisted paths. \n In the land
    of sultans and hidden passageways, the Mercury Feather was awarded to palace
    spies and sages of wisdom \u2014 those who could not be defeated by sword or
    scheme.\n Swift, elusive, untouchable, and unbreakable\u2026 whoever holds it
    becomes the master of strategy and the king of surprise.\n Earn it in Turkey
    mode, and prove that your mind is always two steps ahead."
